{"step_index":131,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:06:00Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated walkthrough.md documenting the 5-second StreamWave MP4 video preview modal integration.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: StreamWave 5-Second MP4 Movie Video Preview Integration\n\nThe **StreamWave Entertainment** platform has been upgraded to integrate a 5-second MP4 demonstration video preview (`/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`) for all movie titles (*Cook Off*, *Neria*, *Gonarezhou*, *Shaina*) when clicking **\"Watch Preview\"**, while preserving the existing audio player for music titles (*Disappear*, *Mudhara Vachida*, *Mbira Magic*, *Akiliz*) when clicking **\"Play Sample\"**.\n\n---\n\n## 🎬 Video Preview Implementation Overview\n\n1. **Asset Location & Public URL**:\n   - Video File: Located at [`public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4) (Copied from `Use_the_uploaded_StreamWave_lo.mp4`).\n   - Relative URL: `/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`.\n   - Direct Static Delivery: Video bytes are retrieved directly by the browser from `/media/streamwave-preview.mp4` without passing through FastAPI function execution.\n\n2. **Movie Catalogue Schema**:\n   - Added `preview_url: \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\"` for all movie entries in [`data/media.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/data/media.json).\n   - Updated Pydantic schema in [`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py) with `preview_url: Optional[str] = None`.\n\n3. **Dedicated Video Player Modal (`<dialog id=\"video-dialog\">`)**:\n   - Opens when clicking **\"🎬 Watch Preview\"** on any movie card or the featured hero banner (*Cook Off*).\n   - Displays the selected movie title above the video player.\n   - HTML5 `<video>` element with `controls`, `playsinline`, `preload=\"metadata\"`, 16:9 aspect ratio, and black background (`#000000`).\n   - Plays automatically upon direct user click.\n   - Shows **🔄 Replay Preview** and **Close** buttons when the 5-second video finishes (`ended` event).\n\n4. **Modal Behavior & Accessibility**:\n   - Closes via: Close button, top-right `✕` icon, `Escape` key, or backdrop click outside player.\n   - Closing pauses video, resets `currentTime = 0`, unlocks body scroll (`overflow = ''`), and restores keyboard focus to the button that opened the modal.\n   - Disables background scrolling (`overflow = 'hidden'`) while active.\n\n5. **Playback Event Telemetry**:\n   - Triggers `POST /api/play-events` with actual movie `media_id` on video start.\n   - Guarantees one single telemetry event per movie playback session (prevents duplicate logs on pause/resume or replay).\n\n---\n\n## 📁 Files Changed\n\n| File Path | Description |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| [`public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4) | Static 5-second MP4 demonstration video preview asset. |\n| [`scripts/copy_preview_video.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/scripts/copy_preview_video.py) | Utility script ensuring `streamwave-preview.mp4` is present from Downloads. |\n| [`data/media.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/data/media.json) | Configured `preview_url: \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\"` for all movie items. |\n| [`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py) | Added `preview_url` field to `MediaItem` Pydantic model and automatic asset check. |\n| [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html) | Added `<dialog id=\"video-dialog\">` video modal with 16:9 player, title header, Replay button, and close controls. |\n| [`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css) | Added video modal styles (`max-width: 960px`, `#000000` background, 16:9 aspect ratio, responsive mobile rules). |\n| [`public/js/app.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/js/app.js) | Implemented `playMoviePreview()`, video `ended` replay display, `closeVideoModal()`, focus restoration, and deduplicated POST logging. |\n| [`tests/test_api.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/tests/test_api.py) | Added automated tests for movie `preview_url` fields and movie play event logging. |\n| [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/README.md) | Updated technical documentation with video preview configuration and static asset details. |\n\n---\n\n## 🧪 Test & Verification Results\n\n- **Automated Tests**: 100% passing (All 14 unit test cases in `tests/test_api.py` passed).\n- **Video Path**: `public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4` (Served as `/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`).\n- **Interactive Verification**:\n  - Clicking **🎬 Watch Preview** on *Cook Off*, *Neria*, *Gonarezhou*, or *Shaina* opens the video modal and plays the 5-second video.\n  - Video finishes after 5 seconds and shows **🔄 Replay Preview**.\n  - Clicking **Close**, pressing **Escape**, or clicking the backdrop closes the video modal, pauses playback, resets to 0 seconds, and restores keyboard focus.\n  - Clicking **🎵 Play Sample** on music items continues using the HTML5 audio bar.\n  - Playback start triggers a single `POST /api/play-events` request with status `201 Created`.\n","Description":"Update walkthrough.md with 5-second MP4 video preview implementation details","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Updating walkthrough.md"}}]}
