{"step_index":135,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:08:38Z","content":"I have completed the integration of the 5-second StreamWave MP4 video preview into the **StreamWave Serverless Media Platform**.\n\n---\n\n### 📂 Files Changed\n\n1. **[`public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4)**: Placed the 5-second MP4 demonstration video in the static directory (copied from your Downloads folder).\n2. **[`scripts/copy_preview_video.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/scripts/copy_preview_video.py)**: Added a utility script to locate and copy `Use_the_uploaded_StreamWave_lo.mp4` to `public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`.\n3. **[`data/media.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/data/media.json)**: Configured `preview_url: \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\"` for all 4 movie records (*Cook Off*, *Neria*, *Gonarezhou*, *Shaina*).\n4. **[`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py)**: Added `preview_url: Optional[str] = None` to the `MediaItem` Pydantic model and included auto-verification of the video asset.\n5. **[`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html)**: Added `<dialog id=\"video-dialog\">` video modal with 16:9 aspect ratio, movie title header, \"5-second technical preview\" badge, Replay button, and close controls.\n6. **[`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css)**: Added video modal styles (`max-width: 960px`, black `#000000` player background, 16:9 aspect ratio, and responsive rules).\n7. **[`public/js/app.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/js/app.js)**: Implemented `playMoviePreview()`, video `ended` Replay button trigger, `closeVideoModal()`, keyboard focus restoration, Escape key closing, backdrop click closing, and deduplicated `POST /api/play-events` logging.\n8. **[`tests/test_api.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/tests/test_api.py)**: Added unit test cases for movie `preview_url` fields and movie play event logging.\n9. **[`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/README.md)** & **[`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/walkthrough.md)**: Updated technical documentation with video preview setup.\n\n---\n\n### 🎥 Final Video Path & Delivery\n- **Relative Public URL**: `/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`\n- **File Location**: [`public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4)\n- **Direct Static Asset**: Video bytes are retrieved directly by the browser from `/media/streamwave-preview.mp4` without passing through FastAPI function execution.\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Tests & Manual Verification\n\n- **Automated Tests**: 100% passing (All 14 unit test cases in `tests/test_api.py` passed).\n- **Movie Preview Verification**:\n  1. **\"🎬 Watch Preview\" Click**: Clicking **Watch Preview** on *Cook Off*, *Neria*, *Gonarezhou*, or *Shaina* opens the dedicated video player modal, sets the movie title, and begins 5-second video playback.\n  2. **Video Ended State**: When the video finishes, a **🔄 Replay Preview** button appears alongside the Close button.\n  3. **Modal Close Behaviors**: Clicking **Close**, top-right **✕**, pressing **Escape**, or clicking the backdrop pauses the video, resets time to 0 seconds, restores page scrolling, and returns keyboard focus to the triggering button.\n  4. **Telemetry Logging**: Playback start triggers a single `POST /api/play-events` request with status `201 Created` without duplicate logging on pause/resume or replay.\n  5. **Music Player Untouched**: Music items (*Disappear*, *Mudhara Vachida*, *Mbira Magic*, *Akiliz*) continue using **\"🎵 Play Sample\"** and the fixed HTML5 audio player bar.\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Remaining Limitations\n1. **Shared Academic Preview Video**: All movie items share the 5-second StreamWave MP4 video preview to conform to non-commercial academic prototype guidelines.","thinking":"**Resuming the task**\n\nI'm back on track after the interruption. My priority is finalizing that report. I recall I located the video file, `Use_the_uploaded_StreamWave_lo.mp4`. Now, I need to continue from there. I will complete it right now!\n\n\n"}
