{"step_index":137,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:34:41Z","thinking":"**Defining the Logo Implementation**\n\nI've received the StreamWave logo image and my initial focus is now on integrating it appropriately. My current priority is determining the ideal method for incorporating this image into the streaming company's branding, considering factors such as size, placement, and visual consistency.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nCopies the uploaded StreamWave logo image to public/images/streamwave-logo.png\n\"\"\"\n\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nPROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\nSOURCE_IMAGE = PROJECT_ROOT / \".user_uploaded\" / \"media_1787682860034.png\"\nTARGET_DIR = PROJECT_ROOT / \"public\" / \"images\"\nTARGET_IMAGE = TARGET_DIR / \"streamwave-logo.png\"\n\n\ndef copy_logo():\n    TARGET_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    if SOURCE_IMAGE.exists():\n        shutil.copyfile(SOURCE_IMAGE, TARGET_IMAGE)\n        print(f\"✅ Logo successfully copied to {TARGET_IMAGE} ({TARGET_IMAGE.stat().st_size} bytes)\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"❌ Source image not found at {SOURCE_IMAGE}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    copy_logo()\n","Description":"Create python script to copy uploaded logo to public/images/streamwave-logo.png","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\scripts\\copy_logo.py","toolAction":"Creating script to copy logo","toolSummary":"Creating script to copy logo"}}]}
