{"step_index":139,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:34:57Z","thinking":"**Ensuring Logo Presence**\n\nI've decided to incorporate `copy_logo()` within the `app.py` initialization process. I'll also add a call to `ensure_logo_asset()` in `app.py`, to make sure that `public/images/streamwave-logo.png` is always present at startup.\n\n\n**Implementing Logo Logic**\n\nI've crafted a function, `ensure_logo_asset()`, to handle logo presence, creating the directory and copying the image if missing or empty. This function now includes a check for the source image's existence and size before copying, along with logging to report successes or failures. I've also updated `public/index.html` and `public/css/styles.css`, incorporating the logo image into the brand navbar and footer and defining its styling.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>StreamWave Entertainment | Serverless Media Platform</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/styles.css\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#featured\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Entertainment Home\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"brand-logo-img\">\n            </a>\n\n            <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"#featured\" class=\"nav-link active\">Home</a>\n                <a href=\"#catalogue\" class=\"nav-link\">Catalogue</a>\n                <a href=\"/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"nav-link developer-link\" title=\"Open API Documentation in Swagger\">\n                    Developer <span class=\"ext-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div class=\"serverless-badge-sm\" title=\"Non-commercial academic serverless deployment\">\n                <span class=\"pulse-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span>Serverless Demo</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n        <!-- Hero / Featured Content Section -->\n        <section id=\"featured\" class=\"hero-section\" aria-label=\"Featured Media Release\">\n            <div class=\"hero-backdrop\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-tag-group\">\n                    <span class=\"hero-tag\">FEATURED ZIMBABWEAN RELEASE</span>\n                    <span class=\"tech-sample-pill\">5-second technical preview</span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\" title=\"Cook Off (2017)\">Cook Off</h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"meta-tag\">Movie</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>2017</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>Comedy / Romance</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>1h 41m</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">\n                    An uplifting Zimbabwean romantic comedy following Anesu, a single mother in Harare who enters a high-stakes national cooking competition against all odds.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.playMoviePreview('1', this)\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎬</span> Watch Preview\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.openDetails('1', this)\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ℹ</span> View Details\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Catalogue Filter & Search Section -->\n        <section id=\"catalogue\" class=\"catalogue-section\" aria-label=\"Media Catalogue\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Media Catalogue</h2>\n                <span class=\"item-count\" id=\"item-count\">Loading...</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Controls Toolbar -->\n            <div class=\"toolbar\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Catalogue Search and Filtering Controls\">\n                <div class=\"search-box\">\n                    <span class=\"search-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</span>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"search-input\" placeholder=\"Search title, artist, director, or genre...\" aria-label=\"Search media catalogue\">\n                    <button id=\"clear-search\" class=\"clear-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear search query\" style=\"display: none;\">✕</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"filter-group\">\n                    <!-- Type Filter Tabs -->\n                    <div class=\"type-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Filter media by type\">\n                        <button class=\"type-tab active\" data-type=\"\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">All</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"movie\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Movies</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"music\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Music</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Genre Dropdown -->\n                    <div class=\"select-wrapper\">\n                        <select id=\"genre-select\" aria-label=\"Filter media by genre\">\n                            <option value=\"\">All Genres</option>\n                            <option value=\"Comedy\">Comedy</option>\n                            <option value=\"Drama\">Drama</option>\n                            <option value=\"Action\">Action</option>\n                            <option value=\"Zimdancehall\">Zimdancehall</option>\n                            <option value=\"Afro-pop\">Afro-pop</option>\n                            <option value=\"Traditional\">Traditional</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- UI States Container -->\n            <div id=\"state-container\">\n                <!-- Loading State -->\n                <div id=\"loading-state\" class=\"state-view\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading content\"></div>\n                    <p>Loading Zimbabwean media catalogue...</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Error State -->\n                <div id=\"error-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚠️</div>\n                    <h3>Failed to Load Media</h3>\n                    <p id=\"error-message\">Unable to fetch media catalogue from serverless backend.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.fetchMedia()\">Try Again</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Empty State -->\n                <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</div>\n                    <h3>No Media Found</h3>\n                    <p>No