{"step_index":141,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:35:14Z","thinking":"**Styling the Logo**\n\nI'm now focusing on updating the `public/css/styles.css` file to style the logo image. Currently, I'm checking the styling for the `.brand-logo-img` and `.footer-logo-img` selectors to ensure they're consistent and optimized. I'm taking the opportunity to make a few tweaks to the design to fit the overall user experience.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   StreamWave Entertainment - Responsive Media Platform Stylesheet\n   Dark Graphite Theme with Restrained Red Accent\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --bg-base: #121214;\n    --bg-surface: #18181c;\n    --bg-elevated: #222228;\n    --bg-hover: #2e2e36;\n    \n    --border-color: #2e2e38;\n    --border-focus: #e50914;\n\n    --text-primary: #f4f4f6;\n    --text-secondary: #a0a0ab;\n    --text-muted: #6e6e7a;\n\n    --accent-red: #e50914;\n    --accent-red-hover: #b80710;\n    --accent-red-subtle: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);\n\n    --font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\n    --radius-md: 6px;\n    \n    --shadow-card: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    --shadow-dialog: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n}\n\n/* Base Resets */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\nbody {\n    background-color: var(--bg-base);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-family: var(--font-family);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    padding-bottom: 110px; /* Space so fixed audio player never obscures