{"step_index":147,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:36:48Z","thinking":"**Adjusting Logo Sizes**\n\nI'm currently investigating how to increase the size of the StreamWave logos. I'm focusing on the CSS for `.brand-logo-img` and `.footer-logo-img` in `public/css/styles.css`. My initial observation is, I'll need to modify the rules there to increase the logo dimensions, and ensure this adjustment doesn't break other page elements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   StreamWave Entertainment - Responsive Media Platform Stylesheet\n   Dark Graphite Theme with Restrained Red Accent\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --bg-base: #121214;\n    --bg-surface: #18181c;\n    --bg-elevated: #222228;\n    --bg-hover: #2e2e36;\n    \n    --border-color: #2e2e38;\n    --border-focus: #e50914;\n\n    --text-primary: #f4f4f6;\n    --text-secondary: #a0a0ab;\n    --text-muted: #6e6e7a;\n\n    --accent-red: #e50914;\n    --accent-red-hover: #b80710;\n    --accent-red-subtle: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);\n\n    --font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\n    --radius-md: 6px;\n    \n    --shadow-card: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    --shadow-dialog: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n}\n\n/* Base Resets */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\nbody {\n    background-color: var(--bg-base);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-family: var(--font-family);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    padding-bottom: 110px; /* Space so fixed audio player never obscures footer */\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\na {\n    color: inherit;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\nbutton, input, select {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: inherit;\n}\n\n/* Accessibility Focus Visible */\n*:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-red);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after {\n        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    }\n}\n\n/* Navigation Bar */\n.navbar {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n    max-width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.brand-logo-img {\n    height: 48px; /* Prominent, clear logo siz